{
  "flow": "agent_create_report",
  "inventory_text": "A1. report_type | ui_label: Service Report Type | type: select | required: yes | constraints: none | auto_filled: yes\nA2. internal_only | ui_label: Internal Only | type: checkbox | required: no | constraints: none | auto_filled: no\nA3. name | ui_label: Service Report Name | type: text | required: yes | constraints: maxLength 256 | auto_filled: yes\nA4. reportDate | ui_label: Service Report Date | type: date | required: yes | constraints: none | auto_filled: yes\nA5. ticket_id | ui_label: Case | type: autocomplete | required: yes | constraints: none | auto_filled: no\nA6. org_id | ui_label: Organization | type: autocomplete | required: yes | constraints: none | auto_filled: yes\nA7. user_id | ui_label: Customer User | type: groupedByCustomer-UserDropdown | required: yes | constraints: none | auto_filled: yes\nA8. appointment_id | ui_label: Appointment | type: autocomplete | required: no | constraints: none | auto_filled: no\nA9. description | ui_label: Description | type: textarea | required: no | constraints: none | auto_filled: no\n\nB3. ticket_id -> appointment_id | EFFECT: reset | GUARD: ticket_id is cleared | REVERSAL: none\nB5. org_id -> ticket_id | EFFECT: filter | GUARD: org_id is set | REVERSAL: none\nB6. user_id -> ticket_id | EFFECT: filter | GUARD: user_id is set | REVERSAL: none\n\nC1. FIELD: report_form_id | CONDITION: {isAgent && reportFormOptions.length > 0} | SHOWN TO: agent | HIDDEN FROM: non-agent | TYPE: role_exclusion\n\nD1. agent CAN see the record | WHEN: they are the assigned staff (staff_id=assigned_staff_id)\nD2. agent CAN see the record | WHEN: they are the accountable staff (staff_id=accountable_staff_id)\nD3. agent CAN see the record | WHEN: they are the creator (staff_id=created_by_staff_id)\nD4. agent CAN see the record | WHEN: they are a collaborator (staff_id in ticket_collaborators)\nD5. agent CAN see the record | WHEN: they have department access (dept_id in userDepartments)\n\nE1. FIELD: report_type | SOURCE: static_enum | DISPLAY LABEL: Fixed Fee & Materials, Time & Material\nE2. FIELD: ticket_id | SOURCE: known_entities.tickets | DISPLAY LABEL: ticket_number - ticket_subject\nE3. FIELD: org_id | SOURCE: known_entities.customers | DISPLAY LABEL: name\nE4. FIELD: user_id | SOURCE: known_entities.customers[*].users | DISPLAY LABEL: name | CONSTRAINT: org_id and user_id must share the same organization\nE5. FIELD: appointment_id | SOURCE: known_entities.tickets[*].appointments | DISPLAY LABEL: title: start_datetime - end_datetime\n\nF1. FIELD: ticket_id | FILTER: exclude_closed_status: true\nF2. FIELD: appointment_id | FILTER: state === \"scheduled\" && !service_report\nF3. FIELD: appointment_id | FILTER: !appt?.service_report",
